<title>UK: EMI drops after PolyGram profit warning.</title>
<headline>EMI drops after PolyGram profit warning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in EMI Plc dropped on Wednesday, tracking a decline in rival music publisher PolyGram after it issued a profit warning, traders said.</p>
<p>EMI shares were down 36-1/2p at 12.43-1/2 stg by 0749 GMT, after reaching a low of 12.42 stg -- the lowest since the demerger of the former Thorn EMI.</p>
<p>In Amsterdam PolyGram shares were down 5.60 guilders at 79.30 guilders.</p>
